{"4111620": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Devoid", "steam_appid": 4111620, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>8 STATIONS LIE BETWEEN YOU AND VALTARIA</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A rogue wormhole brought you here. The only way back is to crawl station to station through a realm fueled by desperation and scarcity. The wormhole's exit awaits at the epicenter of turmoil.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4111620/extras/d34897216c72c59411429a1914888e68.poster.avif?t=1786290473\" width=854 height=364 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4111620/extras/d34897216c72c59411429a1914888e68.webm?t=1786290473\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4111620/extras/d34897216c72c59411429a1914888e68.mp4?t=1786290473\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>COMBAT TICKS WITHOUT A TIMER</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>ENERGY DRAINS WHEN YOU:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Move</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take damage</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Overheat Weapons</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Zoom out</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use certain gear</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>TO GAIN IT BACK:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Eliminate Enemies</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4111620/extras/2d54a13f04f9986dd855a64726ed7f75.poster.avif?t=1786290473\" width=854 height=364 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4111620/extras/2d54a13f04f9986dd855a64726ed7f75.webm?t=1786290473\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4111620/extras/2d54a13f04f9986dd855a64726ed7f75.mp4?t=1786290473\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>BOXED-IN OUTER SPACE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No &quot;return to battlefield&quot; text or  empty map generation.  Tight asteroid clusters and weird mega structures completely surround you, forcing close quarters combat in a true space dungeon. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4111620/extras/f8a156d74dfe1517e7c2738467861b7b.poster.avif?t=1786290473\" width=854 height=364 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4111620/extras/f8a156d74dfe1517e7c2738467861b7b.webm?t=1786290473\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4111620/extras/f8a156d74dfe1517e7c2738467861b7b.mp4?t=1786290473\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>PIXEL DOGFIGHTS THAT FEEL REAL</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Weaponize temperature to lash out heat seeking attacks, slip by enemy flares, or go dark to heat trackers. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Out maneuver targets to strike undetected while keeping your own head on a swivel. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use gravity to pull and repel enemies, curve lasers, move gear and shift projectiles on the battlefield. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Finesse  energy to get the most out of guns, gear and movement because combat is a dance that can’t last forever. </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4111620/extras/380ec30c94ecb8d1a4f9b5ce8e46f857.poster.avif?t=1786290473\" width=854 height=364 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4111620/extras/380ec30c94ecb8d1a4f9b5ce8e46f857.webm?t=1786290473\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4111620/extras/380ec30c94ecb8d1a4f9b5ce8e46f857.mp4?t=1786290473\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>WISHLIST TO STAY IN ORBIT</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It’s easy to get lost in space. Wishlist Devoid to receive important intel regarding development.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4111620/extras/0ee6ab7a5879bc91241209d8d0e27f21.poster.avif?t=1786290473\" width=854 height=364 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4111620/extras/0ee6ab7a5879bc91241209d8d0e27f21.webm?t=1786290473\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4111620/extras/0ee6ab7a5879bc91241209d8d0e27f21.mp4?t=1786290473\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>8 STATIONS LIE BETWEEN YOU AND VALTARIA</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A rogue wormhole brought you here. The only way back is to crawl station to station through a realm fueled by desperation and scarcity. The wormhole's exit awaits at the epicenter of turmoil.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4111620/extras/d34897216c72c59411429a1914888e68.poster.avif?t=1786290473\" width=854 height=364 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4111620/extras/d34897216c72c59411429a1914888e68.webm?t=1786290473\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4111620/extras/d34897216c72c59411429a1914888e68.mp4?t=1786290473\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>COMBAT TICKS WITHOUT A TIMER</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>ENERGY DRAINS WHEN YOU:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Move</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take damage</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Overheat Weapons</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Zoom out</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use certain gear</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>TO GAIN IT BACK:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Eliminate Enemies</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4111620/extras/2d54a13f04f9986dd855a64726ed7f75.poster.avif?t=1786290473\" width=854 height=364 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4111620/extras/2d54a13f04f9986dd855a64726ed7f75.webm?t=1786290473\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4111620/extras/2d54a13f04f9986dd855a64726ed7f75.mp4?t=1786290473\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>BOXED-IN OUTER SPACE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No &quot;return to battlefield&quot; text or  empty map generation.  Tight asteroid clusters and weird mega structures completely surround you, forcing close quarters combat in a true space dungeon. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4111620/extras/f8a156d74dfe1517e7c2738467861b7b.poster.avif?t=1786290473\" width=854 height=364 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4111620/extras/f8a156d74dfe1517e7c2738467861b7b.webm?t=1786290473\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4111620/extras/f8a156d74dfe1517e7c2738467861b7b.mp4?t=1786290473\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>PIXEL DOGFIGHTS THAT FEEL REAL</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Weaponize temperature to lash out heat seeking attacks, slip by enemy flares, or go dark to heat trackers. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Out maneuver targets to strike undetected while keeping your own head on a swivel. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use gravity to pull and repel enemies, curve lasers, move gear and shift projectiles on the battlefield. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Finesse  energy to get the most out of guns, gear and movement because combat is a dance that can’t last forever. </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4111620/extras/380ec30c94ecb8d1a4f9b5ce8e46f857.poster.avif?t=1786290473\" width=854 height=364 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4111620/extras/380ec30c94ecb8d1a4f9b5ce8e46f857.webm?t=1786290473\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4111620/extras/380ec30c94ecb8d1a4f9b5ce8e46f857.mp4?t=1786290473\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>WISHLIST TO STAY IN ORBIT</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It’s easy to get lost in space. Wishlist Devoid to receive important intel regarding development.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4111620/extras/0ee6ab7a5879bc91241209d8d0e27f21.poster.avif?t=1786290473\" width=854 height=364 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4111620/extras/0ee6ab7a5879bc91241209d8d0e27f21.webm?t=1786290473\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4111620/extras/0ee6ab7a5879bc91241209d8d0e27f21.mp4?t=1786290473\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "short_description": "The space dungeon where every move drains energy. Scrap aliens to recharge, loot to survive, and crawl station to station before it's lights out.", "supported_languages": "English", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4111620/701488fdc3ab0a96eab1e55d6afabec588fc3d87/header.jpg?t=1786290473", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4111620/8de29173b4ad2de57ade760d218cfac9386fbbe9/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1786290473", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4111620/8de29173b4ad2de57ade760d218cfac9386fbbe9/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1786290473", "website": "https://devoidgame.com/", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 (64-bit)<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong>  Intel Core i3-6100 / AMD FX-6300<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong>  NVIDIA GTX 660 / AMD Radeon HD 7850</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10/11 (64-bit)<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5-8400 / AMD Ryzen 5 2600<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GTX 1060 / AMD RX 580</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> TBD<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> TBD<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> TBD</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> TBD<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> TBD<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> TBD</li></ul>"}, "linux_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Ubuntu 20.04 LTS or SteamOS 3.0+ (64-bit)<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> 2.0 GHz Dual Core (e.g., Intel Core 2 Duo E8400 / AMD Athlon 64 X2 5600+)<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> OpenGL 3.3 / Vulkan 1.0 compatible (e.g., NVIDIA GeForce 9800 GT / AMD Radeon HD 5670 / Intel HD Graphics 530)</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Ubuntu 22.04 LTS / SteamOS 3+ / Arch Linux<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> 2.5 GHz Quad Core (e.g., Intel Core i5-2500K / AMD FX-6300)<br></li><li><strong>Memory: